Subject: [PATCH] Opt in to a saved per-process Canvas salt and native font scale

Requires browser acceptance before distribution. Does not implement WebAudio or GPU identity.

diff --git a/Source/WebCore/html/CanvasBase.cpp b/Source/WebCore/html/CanvasBase.cpp
